The Level 2[ NV]Q Diploma in Wood Occupations – Timber Frame Erection is designed to assess occupational competence in the workplace[.] Learners[ are] required to demonstrate their skills, knowledge and[ experience] in the construction of timber frame buildings[.] This qualification is suitable for practicing timber frame carpenters.
